      "en_US": [
        "Mr. Pokémon’s House\n",
        "Straight Ahead!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0375_R30_00011",
      "en_US": "Mr. Pokémon’s House"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0375_R30_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "Trainer Tips\r",
        "No stealing other people’s Pokémon!\r",
        "Poké Balls are to be thrown only at\n",
        "wild Pokémon!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0375_R30_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh! You’re wearing the Running Shoes.\r",
        "They make you feel like you are flying,\n",
        "don’t they?\r",
        "But beware of wild Pokémon and\n",
        "Trainers!\r",
        "When you run, the noise will\n",
        "attract them."
      ]
    }
